1. What this notice covers

"The own code" means everything in Smart Trader that its author wrote: the source files of this repository, the
built script and the built browser extension, their texts, translations, pictures and documents, except the
third-party components named in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md. In the built script every module of the own code stands
under a line "Smart Trader: <file>".

